Legenda: Riyal is de munteenheid van Qatar.$$, 'inline'),
  ('a0a06cad-5a97-4665-8a26-a04b481f7dac', 'bf01a0f4-dc4e-43a1-891a-4603d0119af6', $$bron 2: wisselkoers euro in riyal in 2017$$,
